{"cmd":"eval","code":"R.release();T.setGearDbg('helmet');T.setGearDbg('nvg');if(T.trainingDbg.lights().on)T.trainingDbg.toggleLights();T.setWorldTime(0);await wait(300);if(!T.renderer.domElement.classList.contains('nvg-phosphor'))T.toggleNvgDbg();await wait(500);const p=T.player.position;return {position:p.toArray(),active:T.renderer.domElement.classList.contains('nvg-phosphor')};"}